# Large unused model kit (~164 MB of PBR textures) — held out of plain git pending a
# git-LFS decision. Only needed when the fort multi-texture feature is built (M12); it is
# loaded from this local path at runtime in the meantime.
Mazen_Models/modular_fort_01_2k/

# Quaternius Ultimate Stylized Nature Pack — heavy, multi-format (36 MB .blend + FBX + glTF
# duplicates we don't use). Loaded locally from OBJ/ + Textures/ at runtime, like WenrexaTrees.
Mazen_Models/Quaternius Ultimate Stylized Nature Pack/

# In-use imported asset packs (gallery + garden dressing), held out of plain git like the packs
# above — loaded locally at runtime. Together ~1.3 GB; MegaKit alone is 1 GB and ships engine-
# project .zips over GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit, so these cannot live in plain git (a git-LFS
# decision is pending). Keep local copies; do not delete.
Mazen_Models/Dungeons Pack/
Mazen_Models/Nature Pack/
Mazen_Models/Ruins Pack/
Mazen_Models/Stylized Nature MegaKit/
